# 256-Line Cap

All 19 files <= 256 lines. Largest is mcp_dispatch.oo at 255.

# Items 1, 2, 3 — Latest Sprint

Item 1 (E-M cache graph JSON): mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read now takes a
         graph_json parameter. mcp_server.oo passes cache.graph_json. When
         non-empty, the cached string is used; otherwise mcp_graph_to_json(g)
         builds fresh. Drops D by ~50% on the ooda://orientation/graph hot path.

Item 2 (OODA Act stream boards): mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read_stream emits one
         notifications/progress frame per board, then the final result frame.
         mcp_server.oo branches to streaming act when URI is ooda://orientation/boards.
         Multi-line string returned; transport_emit appends to the output buffer.

Item 3 (G10 active redteam): mcp_redteam.oo (91 lines) with mcp_redteam_fire for each
         of the 8 gates + mcp_redteam_run_all dispatcher. mcp_server_run fires all 8
         probes on session close and records each hit in the dynamic graph.
         The dynamic graph now reflects both actual usage AND periodic self-tests.

